**Auren.** A centuries-old sorcerer, accidentally de-aged and stranded
in the wrong era while investigating a dark omen. A young but gifted
sorcerer of the secretive Order of the Fallen Star, Auren volunteered
to use forbidden Time Magic to investigate a dire omen glimpsed by the
Order's seer. The spell stranded him in 21st-century Japan and left
him with the body of a teenager, unable to reverse the effect. With no
way home, Auren has resolved to hunt down whatever threat he was sent
to find. Serious and stubborn, Auren struggles with the indignity of
being treated as a mere teenager despite his true age, and often acts
with an old-fashioned sense of authority he hasn't earned in this era.
He's awkward around women and, for reasons of his own, deeply
distrustful of animals. *Armored +1 (Medieval Armor), Attack +3 (Sword
& Sorcery), Combat Expert +3, Evasive +2, Knowledge +4 (Magic), Magic,
Arcane +3, Smart +2, Vigorous +2; Ageism −1, Arrogant −1, Code of
Conduct −1 (Protecting Women… Begrudgingly), Easily Distracted −2,
Hatred −1 (Animals), Ineptitude −3 (Modern Technology), Quirk −1
(Antiquated Language), Quirk −2 (Stranger in a Strange Land), Stubborn
−2.* Orion (Armor Piercing; Weapon): Roll 5, DX 4, End 0. Auren's
sword, crafted from unbreakable adamantite, is as beautiful as it is
deadly. Fireball (Affinity: Fire; Continued Effect, Effective x2,
Ranged): Roll 5, DX 6, End 20. Auren sends forth a spiralling blast of
flame. Its magic continues to burn after it hits. Ice Spire Array
(Affinity: Ice; Area Effect, Armor Piercing, Overwhelming, Ranged;
Feather Blow, Ineffective): Roll 5, DX 3, End 20. A prismatic array of
frozen shards bombards multiple enemies, piercing any defenses.
Thunder Godspell (Affinity: Lightning; Accurate x2, Effective, Ranged,
Stunning; Delayed): Roll 7, DX 5, End 20. Auren summons a bolt of
electrical energy that stuns its target. It rarely misses. Defense 4.
Health 40, Endurance 60. TV 18.

**Magic, Arcane.** Spells: Mana Shield (Barrier +2; 10+ Endurance),
Wings of Dezantis (Flight +2; 10 Endurance), Feeblemind (Intimidating
+2; 10 Endurance), Breath (Life Support +2; 10 Endurance), Hasten
(Quick +3; 20 Endurance), Atlas Arm (Strong +3; 20 Endurance).

